摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Kilo Gateway free models for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)","id":"gh:1352943387","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"kilo-zen2dsh","slug":"Xyanxhu/kilo-zen2dsh","topics":["dsh-plugin","kilo","kilo-gateway"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Kilo Gateway free models for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# kilo-zen2dsh"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Kilo Gateway and OpenCode Zen free models, natively inside DSH (DeepSeek Harness).**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Kilo's free lane is keyless. OpenCode Zen is an independent, compatibility\nlane whose anonymous avai"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"lability is controlled by the Zen gateway."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`kilo-zen2dsh` registers native DSH `LlmAdapter`s backed by two independent\nOpenAI-compatible gatewa"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"lo-zen2dsh` registers native DSH `LlmAdapter`s backed by two independent\nOpenAI-compatible gateways:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- `kilo2dsh` → Kilo Gateway (`/api/gateway/models` and\n`/api/gateway/chat/completions`)\n- `opencode2"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"dsh` → OpenCode Zen (`/zen/v1/models` and the model-specific\n`/chat/completions` or `/responses` end"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" OpenCode Zen (`/zen/v1/models` and the model-specific\n`/chat/completions` or `/responses` endpoint)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Kilo requests are genuinely keyless: the plugin suppresses the generated\n`Authorization` header on t"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"he wire. Zen's compatibility lane uses the public\n`Bearer public` placeholder and OpenCode-compatibl"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"e request markers by default;\nthe gateway may still require its own anonymous eligibility, quota, or"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" a user\naccount. Neither provider is an authentication or billing bypass."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Highlights"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Native adapter, no child process or local port in the published package.\n- Dynamic free-model disc"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"overy using Kilo's `isFree`/`is_free` flag, with\n`kilo-auto/free` and `:free` suffix compatibility f"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"allbacks.\n- Independent OpenCode Zen catalog and adapter (`opencode2dsh`) with the\ndocumented free m"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"odel IDs, a separate cache, and Responses API routing for\n`muse-spark-1.2-contributor-free`.\n- Zen m"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"odel metadata enrichment from OpenCode's public capability catalog\n(`models.opencode.ai/api.json`): "},{"id":"p10s6","text":"real context windows, output ceilings,\nreasoning, and vision for models whose `/v1/models` entries p"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"ublish none\n(for example `step-5-preview-free`'s 1M window). A metadata outage silently\nfalls back t"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"o the defaults and never blocks discovery; set\n`zenCapabilitiesUrl: \"\"` to disable it.\n- Zen client "},{"id":"p10s9","text":"fingerprint aligned with the 2026-10-14 free-tier gate: the\nofficial `opencode/<channel>/<version>/c"},{"id":"p10s10","text":"li` User-Agent, session ids in the\nclient's descending encoding (inverted `~(timestamp<<12|counter)`"},{"id":"p10s11","text":" layout),\na bare 40-character hex project header, no `x-opencode-request`, and the\nfive injected cor"},{"id":"p10s12","text":"e tools (shell/edit/glob/grep/read) carrying the official\ndefinitions — both synthesised stubs and t"},{"id":"p10s13","text":"he old shapes get 403\nFreeTierError. The anonymous lane follows upstream to\n`https://opencode.ai/inf"},{"id":"p10s14","text":"erence` (override with `zenAnonymousBaseUrl`);\na configured account key keeps using `zenBaseUrl`.\n- "},{"id":"p10s15","text":"Text-output and tool-capable models only, suitable for DSH agent turns.\n- Startup retry, periodic re"},{"id":"p10s16","text":"fresh, seven-day disk cache, and a health snapshot.\n- Optional authenticated Kilo or Zen token for c"},{"id":"p10s17","text":"ompatible deployments; no\naccount token is enabled by default."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"When using this checkout before the npm package is published, build a local\ntarball instead:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Restart `dsh web`, open the model picker, and choose a model in either the\n`kilo2dsh` (Kilo) or `ope"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"ncode2dsh` (Zen) provider group. Node.js 20 or newer is\nrequired."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"The defaults are keyless and point at the public Kilo gateway:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"To use an authenticated gateway token, set `upstreamApiKeyEnv` explicitly.\nLeaving it empty is inten"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"tional; the plugin will not pick up\n`KILO_API_KEY` (or another ambient secret) by accident."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"| Option | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| `mode` | `adapter` | Native adapter. `sidecar` is an optional legacy Go bridge. |\n| `providerId` |"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" `kilo2dsh` | DSH route name. |\n| `gatewayBaseUrl` | `https://api.kilo.ai/api/gateway` | Kilo-compat"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"ible gateway base URL. |\n| `refreshSeconds` | `300` | Model catalog refresh interval. |\n| `requireTo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ols` | `true` | Hide free models that do not advertise `tools`. |\n| `maxOutputTokens` | `524288` | K"},{"id":"p21s5","text":"ilo gateway compatibility output ceiling; `null` disables it. Per-model budgets are derived from the"},{"id":"p21s6","text":" context window and need no configuration. |\n| `upstreamApiKeyEnv` | empty | Environment variable to"},{"id":"p21s7","text":" opt into an explicit token. |\n| `anonymousKey` | empty | Optional token for a private compatible ga"},{"id":"p21s8","text":"teway; empty means no auth header. |\n| `zenEnabled` | `true` | Register the independent OpenCode Zen"},{"id":"p21s9","text":" adapter in adapter mode. |\n| `zenProviderId` | `opencode2dsh` | DSH route name for Zen. |\n| `zenBas"},{"id":"p21s10","text":"eUrl` | `https://opencode.ai/zen` | OpenCode Zen root URL. |\n| `zenUserAgent` | empty | Optional com"},{"id":"p21s11","text":"patibility User-Agent; empty derives the OpenCode format. |\n| `zenApiKeyEnv` | empty | Optional Zen "},{"id":"p21s12","text":"account-token environment variable. |\n| `zenAnonymousKey` | `public` | Zen anonymous placeholder; se"},{"id":"p21s13","text":"t empty for a header-less private deployment. |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Set `zenEnabled: false` when you only want Kilo, or when the Zen gateway is\nreturning an anonymous-l"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ane 429. `sidecar` mode is the legacy Go bridge and\ncurrently exposes Kilo only; the two-provider se"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"tup is implemented in native\nadapter mode."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Wire behavior"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The Kilo adapter sends ordinary OpenAI-compatible JSON/SSE plus Kilo correlation\nheaders (`X-KILOCOD"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"E-EDITORNAME`, `X-KILOCODE-TASKID`, and\n`X-KILOCODE-PROJECTID`). The Zen adapter sends the OpenCode "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"compatibility\nmarker and correlation headers required by the current anonymous lane. This is\nan upst"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"ream compatibility requirement, not a guarantee that Zen will accept\nthird-party clients."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The model filter is deliberately conservative:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"1. `isFree` or `is_free` is authoritative when present.\n2. If the flag is absent, `kilo-auto/free`, "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"`openrouter/free`, and IDs ending\nin `:free`/`-free` are accepted.\n3. Image-output models and models"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" without advertised tool support are hidden\nby default."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### Automatic context and output-limit reconciliation"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Kilo model-directory records are not always internally consistent: a limit may\nbe present on the top"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"-level record, `top_provider`, or a nested `limit(s)`\nobject, and compatible gateways use several sp"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ellings. The adapter merges\nthose declarations and uses the smallest positive context limit. It keep"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"s the\nadvertised context window for prompt history, while calculating a separate\nsafe output budget."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The current gateway catalog advertises `minimax/minimax-m3:free` with a\n943,718-token completion lim"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"it, but the backend rejects requests above\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
